 {
  "id": "sce340:00685",
  "jp": "謎の人物「ワシはベイオという名の者は知らん。{nl}　まったくもって、見当外れの人違いだ、お嬢さん」",
  "off": 1669,
  "len": 64,
  "en": "Mysterious Figure: I know of no one by the name of Baio. You've got the wrong man entirely, young lady.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 1,
  "text_off": 1673,
  "text_len": 59
 },
 {
  "id": "sce340:006C5",
  "jp": "メリッサ「声を変えられていても私には分かります。{nl}　なぜ正体を隠されておられるのですか？」",
  "off": 1733,
  "len": 58,
  "en": "Melissa: Even with your voice disguised, I can tell. Why are you hiding who you are?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 1,
  "text_off": 1737,
  "text_len": 53
 },
 {
  "id": "sce340:006FF",
  "jp": "謎の人物「ワシはベイオなんぞ知らぬと言っておるだろ、{nl}　メリッサ‥‥い、いや、お嬢さん」",
  "off": 1791,
  "len": 57,
  "en": "Mysterious Figure: I told you, I know nothing of any Baio, Melissa... I-I mean, young lady.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 1,
  "text_off": 1795,
  "text_len": 52
 },
 {
